{
  "source": "voice",
  "durationMs": 148036,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 11981,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Okay, quick question.",
          "startMs": 0,
          "endMs": 1197
        },
        {
          "text": "Can one square be two colors at the same time?",
          "startMs": 1811,
          "endMs": 4792
        },
        {
          "text": "Not a trick of the light.",
          "startMs": 5385,
          "endMs": 6282
        },
        {
          "text": "Actually two colors, and both of them true.",
          "startMs": 6663,
          "endMs": 9129
        },
        {
          "text": "Sounds fake, right?",
          "startMs": 9776,
          "endMs": 10586
        },
        {
          "text": "Stick with me.",
          "startMs": 11174,
          "endMs": 11697
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "idea",
      "startMs": 11981,
      "endMs": 35142,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Back in the sixties, the artist Josef Albers showed that a color can look different depending on what's next to it.",
          "startMs": 12264,
          "endMs": 17665
        },
        {
          "text": "But that's just your eyes.",
          "startMs": 18286,
          "endMs": 19683
        },
        {
          "text": "Qontext goes way further.",
          "startMs": 20148,
          "endMs": 21867
        },
        {
          "text": "In quantum physics, some things don't have one fixed answer.",
          "startMs": 22454,
          "endMs": 25720
        },
        {
          "text": "What you get depends on how you check.",
          "startMs": 26207,
          "endMs": 28046
        },
        {
          "text": "So here, a tile really is one color when you read it along its row, and a different color when you read it down its column.",
          "startMs": 28579,
          "endMs": 34817
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dare",
      "startMs": 35142,
      "endMs": 53212,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Don't buy it?",
          "startMs": 35466,
          "endMs": 35934
        },
        {
          "text": "Try Mermin's Dare.",
          "startMs": 36435,
          "endMs": 37472
        },
        {
          "text": "Nine tiles, six rules.",
          "startMs": 37953,
          "endMs": 39670
        },
        {
          "text": "Give every tile a plus or a minus and make all six rules happy.",
          "startMs": 40103,
          "endMs": 43756
        },
        {
          "text": "You'll get five.",
          "startMs": 44261,
          "endMs": 44886
        },
        {
          "text": "Everyone gets five.",
          "startMs": 45348,
          "endMs": 46262
        },
        {
          "text": "A computer tried all five hundred and twelve ways.",
          "startMs": 46851,
          "endMs": 49630
        },
        {
          "text": "Quantum gets six, every single time.",
          "startMs": 50190,
          "endMs": 52881
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "world",
      "startMs": 53212,
      "endMs": 66725,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "That's what the Qontext website runs on.",
          "startMs": 53543,
          "endMs": 55195
        },
        {
          "text": "The second you open it, it rolls the dice and picks colors just for you.",
          "startMs": 55644,
          "endMs": 59131
        },
        {
          "text": "That's your world.",
          "startMs": 59549,
          "endMs": 60241
        },
        {
          "text": "Your friend gets a different one.",
          "startMs": 60578,
          "endMs": 61660
        },
        {
          "text": "And colors you haven't scrolled to yet aren't decided.",
          "startMs": 62219,
          "endMs": 64608
        },
        {
          "text": "They settle the moment you look.",
          "startMs": 65060,
          "endMs": 66387
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rooms",
      "startMs": 66725,
      "endMs": 86633,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Each room shows off a different trick.",
          "startMs": 67063,
          "endMs": 68777
        },
        {
          "text": "Unity Wheel turns quantum math into perfect color combos.",
          "startMs": 69231,
          "endMs": 72624
        },
        {
          "text": "Fringe mixes colors like waves of light.",
          "startMs": 73031,
          "endMs": 75207
        },
        {
          "text": "Pentacle gives you five colors that never clash.",
          "startMs": 75709,
          "endMs": 78268
        },
        {
          "text": "Spooky Pair links a light design and a dark one, so they react together.",
          "startMs": 78690,
          "endMs": 82191
        },
        {
          "text": "And Unpaintables shows shapes you literally can't color by the rules.",
          "startMs": 82684,
          "endMs": 86430
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "phase",
      "startMs": 86633,
      "endMs": 97123,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Oh, and light mode versus dark mode?",
          "startMs": 86835,
          "endMs": 88588
        },
        {
          "text": "Tap the moon.",
          "startMs": 89040,
          "endMs": 89579
        },
        {
          "text": "You get a whole dial: light, dark, and every kind of dusk in between.",
          "startMs": 89951,
          "endMs": 94117
        },
        {
          "text": "The text stays easy to read the whole way round.",
          "startMs": 94635,
          "endMs": 96851
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "atelier",
      "startMs": 97123,
      "endMs": 117240,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Want to make something?",
          "startMs": 97394,
          "endMs": 99357
        },
        {
          "text": "Open the Atelier, the studio.",
          "startMs": 99617,
          "endMs": 101547
        },
        {
          "text": "Play with every room, pick your colors, and save your design as one short code you can share.",
          "startMs": 101802,
          "endMs": 105089
        },
        {
          "text": "Bouncer works like a bouncer at a club: if your text is hard to read on any color, it's not getting in.",
          "startMs": 105591,
          "endMs": 110672
        },
        {
          "text": "Handoff sends your colors to code and design tools, and Walk-By makes prints that change color as you walk past.",
          "startMs": 111163,
          "endMs": 116990
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "observer",
      "startMs": 117240,
      "endMs": 131125,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Got a website?",
          "startMs": 117489,
          "endMs": 118058
        },
        {
          "text": "Drop in Observer.",
          "startMs": 118451,
          "endMs": 119187
        },
        {
          "text": "It's one tiny file, and every visitor gets their own world.",
          "startMs": 119606,
          "endMs": 122833
        },
        {
          "text": "No server, no tracking.",
          "startMs": 123296,
          "endMs": 124685
        },
        {
          "text": "Designer?",
          "startMs": 125132,
          "endMs": 125582
        },
        {
          "text": "Superpose puts the same grid in Figma, with a row version and a column version of every color.",
          "startMs": 125970,
          "endMs": 130901
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "probe",
      "startMs": 131125,
      "endMs": 142042,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Want the real deal?",
          "startMs": 131349,
          "endMs": 132096
        },
        {
          "text": "Probe runs it all on an actual IBM quantum computer.",
          "startMs": 132418,
          "endMs": 135692
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Notary checks the results and stamps them with a seal, so anyone can see exactly where your colors came from.",
          "startMs": 136096,
          "endMs": 141810
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "outro",
      "startMs": 142042,
      "endMs": 148036,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "That's Qontext.",
          "startMs": 142274,
          "endMs": 143085
        },
        {
          "text": "Colors that depend on how you look at them.",
          "startMs": 143416,
          "endMs": 145363
        },
        {
          "text": "Open the Atelier and make your own world.",
          "startMs": 145812,
          "endMs": 147762
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
